  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>Roughly chop tomato. </li>\n• <li>Slice lemon into wedges. </li>\n• <li>Grate carrot. </li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69d8423868ee73d4d3ff91f2/step-0a9ab900.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>In a medium saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.</li>\n• <li>Cook carrot, stirring occasionally, until softened, 2-3 mins. Stir in tomato &amp; herb seasoning and cook until fragrant, 1 min.</li>\n• <li>Add the water and butter and bring to the boil.</li>\n• <li>Stir in couscous. Cover with a lid and remove from heat. Set aside until water is absorbed, 5 mins. Fluff up couscous with a fork.</li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69d8423868ee73d4d3ff91f2/step-4d789410.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>While couscous is cooking, pat haloumi dry and cut into 1cm slices.</li>\n• <li>In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.</li>\n• <li>Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 mins each side.</li>\n• <li>Remove from heat and add the honey and a splash of water to the pan, turning haloumi to coat.</li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69d8423868ee73d4d3ff91f2/step-6ec0c520.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>Add baby spinach, tomato, a squeeze of lemon juice and a drizzle of vinegar to the couscous. Toss to combine. Season to taste.</li>\n• <li>Divide couscous between bowls. Top with haloumi. </li>\n• <li>Drizzle with Greek-style yoghurt to serve.</li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69d8423868ee73d4d3ff91f2/step-0cfcbc30.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
